              "newText": "Upon payment of the applicable Fees, Customer and its Affiliates receive a perpetual, irrevocable, worldwide, royalty-free, fully paid licence to use, reproduce, modify, and create derivative works from each Deliverable, and to permit contractors acting on their behalf to do so, for Customer's business purposes, transferable in accordance with Section 13.3. Sections 13.2 and 13.3 control over any inconsistent limitation in this Section 14.2."
